Bridging Mod for Sunrise 26.3 (version 0.5.0)

A port of Bridging Mod (2.7.0+26.3) by CG360 (Will Scully).
Original source: https://github.com/CloudG360/BridgingMod
Original licence: MIT

Ported to Sunrise by arismoko: the reach-around path traversal, slab/trapdoor alignment,
outline rendering, crosshair indicator, and client configuration are implemented in Rust
on Sunrise's typed mod API (no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the
same licence as the original (MIT); the licence text is in LICENSE.

The mod icon, crosshair indicator sprites (assets/bridgingmod/textures/gui/sprites/indicator/),
and translations (assets/bridgingmod/lang/) are carried over from the original project under
its MIT licence.
